        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>22 Inch Castle Door Pull, First Impressions CST1022RDDSBRPLBRR</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCustom 22\" overall Polished Brass Castle 1 Door Pull.  Thrubolt mounted for 1-3/16\" wood door.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CST1RDDSBRRR Door Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align =\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>The First Impressions Castle 1 door pull comes standard with the  <a href=\"/products/2-3-4-inch-decorative-reed-rosette-first-impressions-bst03002r\">2-3/4\" Diameter Round Reed Rosettes</a> for an extra level of decoration. The rosettes are removable if desired.</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<li>Total Length: 22\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 15.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>",
